exists su name hear fixture ob text "Fixture transcript." be default ya
su name loop be refinery def
su name draft ob text "Write three short sentences about rain." for name mind to name text mind-out be write do
su name speak from ve name draft ob name mind-out to filename "artifacts/say/refinery-fixture.wav" be say do
su name ensure from ve name speak ob text "fixture audio" to filename "artifacts/say/refinery-fixture.wav" be write do
su name listen from ve name ensure from filename "artifacts/say/refinery-fixture.wav" become wo srt to filename "artifacts/hear/refinery-fixture.srt" be hear do
su name report from ve name listen ob text "Fixture transcript." be write do
prah

from name loop be refinery do
